ext":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-14839":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日VAMPS\nHALLOWEEN PARTY2013\nの最終日が終了しました٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終日も呼んで頂けるなんて\n本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで色んなアーティストさんの\n曲を裏で聞いていてメンバーで\n盛り上がったりしていて\n自分達が出演している時は\n勿論のこと、裏で出番待ち\nしているときも楽しめました♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんといっても1番\n嬉しかったのはあたし達が\n『おいでシャンプー』を歌っている\n時にHYDEさんが裏で一緒に\n踊っていてくれたらしくて...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんたる...なんたる喜ばしいこと੯ू❛ัू ໒꒱ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、来年もお呼ばれされたいな\nあー本当に楽しいPARTYでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてHALLOWEEN PARTY\nということで乃木坂も仮装‼︎\nちなみに1日目はこちら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/10/27/8475547/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫娘。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言った通りに首輪つけてますよ？\n飼い主は決まりそうかな？笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身だとこんな風に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/10/27/8475547/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うん。2本足で立ってる猫だね。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう顔を派手に弄ったりするの\n好きだからもっともっと色んな風に\nしてみたーーーーい٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最終日‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか気合いいれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/10/27/8475547/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"....え。これはゾンビイメージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ目つき悪い....笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、わざとクマを作って\n血色悪い感じにしました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/10/27/8475547/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにななとおそろ....\n2人セットだと更に怖さ増すね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わったあと自分の顔が\nゾンビになっていることを\n忘れて鏡を見て びっくりした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにやってるんだ私。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の顔に驚くなんて...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/10/27/8475547/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、これでも異様に引き立ってる\nよね...あたし。笑い\n皆オバケなはずなのに...笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばけの素質ありなのか.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-20394":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ〜..* Rottyです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜 何やこれ。 可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/09/18/6994148/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"